1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,145
The library that mattered most was not at home but Willesden Public Library, five minutes' walk away.

2
00:00:06,145 --> 00:00:14,218
He calls it his Ur library: Ur is a German prefix meaning the original, the first of all libraries.

3
00:00:14,218 --> 00:00:17,942
There, he says, he received his real education.

4
00:00:17,942 --> 00:00:23,528
He disliked school; in class, information went in one ear and out the other.

5
00:00:23,528 --> 00:00:25,195
He could not learn passively.

6
00:00:25,195 --> 00:00:28,125
He was not a good pupil, but a good learner.

7
00:00:28,125 --> 00:00:39,479
In the library he roamed the shelves freely, followed what fascinated him, became himself, and enjoyed the quiet companionship of other readers on quests of their own.

